  Description: "The bloody games of the arena taught you the art of combat. Before
    you attained true fame, you departed\u2014or escaped\u2014the arena to explore
    the world. Your skill at drawing both blood and a crowd's attention pay off in
    a new adventuring life. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength
    or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Performance
    skill and the Gladiatorial Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Impressive
    Performance] skill feat."
